data: {"id": "94c2ba4f66f04f3c-thinking-parallel_evidence-618", "run_id": "94c2ba4f66f04f3c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "### 4. 获取 Pod YAML 以检查 Env/Volumes/Secrets/ConfigMaps 引用\n\n`kubectl_describe` 显示容器没有 `Mounts`，但在 `Environment` 区块也是空的，这很奇怪。如果 Pod Spec 中引用了 Secret 或 ConfigMap 的 `env` 或 `envFrom`，但 describe 输出被截断或省略了，需要通过 YAML 查看完整的 `spec.containers[0].env` 或 `spec.volumes`。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 4, "ts_ms": 1789057224121, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

