data: {"id": "94c2ba4f66f04f3c-thinking-parallel_evidence-1422", "run_id": "94c2ba4f66f04f3c", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 1. 实体身份与生命周期确认\n\n- **Pod**: `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-h4lt9`, UID: `f3574e3f-58ab-46ac-a529-8e83111140d8`\n- **控制器**: 受 `ReplicaSet/workload-6584f97c76` 控制 (归属 `Deployment/workload`)。\n- **节点**: 调度至 `node2` (10.2.0.50)。\n- **阶段**: `Pending`。自创建以来 `restartCount=0`。\n- **网络**: Pod IP `172.16.104.10`，CNI 已分配 ID。\n\n## 2. 事实证据汇总\n\n1. **异常持续存在且未恢复**:\n    - `kubectl_get_yaml` 和 `describe` 均显示 Pod 状态为 `Pending`，容器 `app` 状态为 `Waiting`。\n    - `reason`: `CreateContainerConfigError`。\n\n2. **`CreateConta", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1789057236011, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

